+| Canonical household IDs | reuse reviewed map and existing walk | Compare local and framework semantics on source metadata and targeted tests; no new ID rule |
+| Native observation/factor/quantity semantics | preserve existing loaders/helper/transforms | GH1198/GH849 already own these definitions |
+| Regression coverage | extend narrowly | Actual491 parent controls must discriminate both wrong Make output and wrong Default raw end state |
+
+## §6 Source-bound decision and remaining review
+
+On 2026-10-22 root approved retiring only the duplicate country crop script and var rule, adjusting the all-list, retaining a native-only phony alias, and adding documentation/regressions. The phase0 check binds the seven source hashes and the clean ledger-first commit `a53f71bad6a26307eb83d051b57a6cdd9c9424cc`.
+
+The framework already owns the required assembly. Both no-stage Default paths use `load_from_waves`; Make with `country_builder=False` uses that same implementation. `absent_subset_frame` runs before a barren descent/cache write. `_replay_wave_stamp`, `_replay_grain_audit`, the finalizer and `id_walk` supply the existing transport; no helper, framework, scheme, native loader, map, factor, reducer or science change is needed. The reviewed map contains 11,343 string mappings (1,833 + 3,305 + 3,176 + 3,029), all terminal, so the old local one-pass and framework closure-resolved walks agree on this actual map. The source-order wave list equals framework sorted order.
+
+The implementation commit is `a4e154ba0`; `69bcbd5ff` corrects only the regression fixture's omission of already-required `harvest_month` and `intercropped`. Every runtime source byte is tested on clean `69bcbd5ff`; this final ledger update is the only later change. Normal commit hooks publish each commit. The approved five-path diff is the ledger, Uganda CONTENTS, Uganda Makefile, deleted country crop script, and the new regression file.
+
+### Phase 3 verification: author evidence complete, independent review pending
+
+- Eight targeted regressions pass. The exact actual `491daf5654b9ee45332bec97e1296ae821ff46d5` parent fails seven and passes one; actual controller and worker package/config/cwd/rootdir identities are asserted before and after collection. The selected existing ID-walk, coverage, no-builder, stale-cache, grain, observation and factor tests pass 170 cases with zero skips/errors. The API audit exits zero.
