+- All 59 accepted actors exit zero: 44 Country requests, 12 Feature requests, two unmodified scoped scanners and one direct native Make call. The grid covers supported 2018-19 and barren 2005-06, true cold L2, both alternating population orders, ordinary all-wave calls and fresh-process warm controls on both heads/backends. Direct Make builds seven native waves and no crop country parquet.
+- Actual-parent Default cold-barren returns zero public rows but stores 133,761 raw rows from other waves under false `['2005-06']` coverage. The candidate produces zero rows without creating a crop country cache. Three populated-barren controls preserve the existing valid crop parquet byte-for-byte. Candidate raw waves stay within truthful coverage, and Make writes no crop country parquet. All twelve final footprints match their exact expected paths/producer receipts (177 final cache footers).
+- All-wave rows remain 133,761, including 928 eligible null-v rows and zero null `production_obs`; supported 2018-19 remains 15,630 rows. The exact all-wave harvest total remains 42,026,694.99297963. No historical counts are forced. All seven native tables, complete native footer bytes and production-observation/factor fields remain exact across 21 pairs. This held release has no native crop grain-audit footer or crop grain-ledger records on either head; nonempty audit transport is proved by the synthetic native-write regressions under both backends and unchanged replay code.
+- The accepted comparator rejects 49 calibrated faults, including tiny/nextafter numeric differences, nullable/object scalar type changes, altered unused domains/codes/widths, string storage/NA policy and typed attrs/record fields/key types. Of 65 full-frame pairs, 61 pass and four zero-row pairs retain strict FAIL verdicts. All nonempty public/raw/Feature/harvest pairs pass. Five additional actual-parent Make all-wave public/raw/harvest/cold-warm pairs pass. No frames are normalized, reordered or cast.
