+- Both unmodified scanners produce 22 literally equal ordered warning records and no failures. Existing broad Make wave eviction after a subset is preserved and belongs to GH1210. GH1196 string-null behavior, GH1205 area/key repair and the documented scientific/source caveats remain separate.
